{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>וירב.</b> From the binyan hif'il:" "<b>בגוע אחינו.</b> A verbal noun, like כְּשָׁכַב אֲדֹנִי הַמֶּלֶךְ (when my lord the king lay down)." "<b>אחינו.</b> They are the wilderness generation who died, and they are the servants of HaShem:"], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:18:27.459319075Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}